Package: turf
Title: TURF Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tyler", "Solloway", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tyler@resondex.com")
Description: Total Unduplicated Reach and Frequency (TURF) analysis for
    survey research. Supports brute force, parallel, and hybrid search
    strategies for finding optimal item combinations.
